 "news": {
  "date": "2026-11-03",
  "asof": "2026-11-04 12:46 UTC",
  "headline": "Democrats flip North Carolina as chips bounce \u2014 and AMD beats after the close",
  "standfirst": "On election day the Nasdaq rose 0.83% and the S&P 0.36% as the chip index rebounded 2.63%, while the Dow fell 0.38% and most stocks fell. Job openings and factory orders beat, and a December hike is priced at about 78%. The US struck Iran's Qeshm Island and Vance spoke of a possible settlement; WTI eased to $96.09. After the close AMD beat and guided higher, and Democrats flipped North Carolina's Senate seat, with control of both chambers not yet projected. The book is flat; Q4 is +34.64 realised, heat 0R.",
