    "note": "<b>Wednesday is the first session with election results</b>, and AMD and Arista trade on their numbers. <b>Qualcomm, AppLovin and DoorDash</b> report after the close, and <b>October payrolls</b> arrive on Friday with a consensus of about 55,000. The Fed meets on <b>8-9 December</b>."
